				</header>
				<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="26" class="elementor elementor-26" data-elementor-post-type="page">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dbf67a6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="dbf67a6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-658fbd0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="658fbd0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3ec598a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3ec598a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">About Us</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a0bb4da elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a0bb4da" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									We are a full service bathroom renovation company based in Christchurch, Canterbury with a 45 year history of converting and remodeling bathrooms in the city.

								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7e0c572 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="7e0c572" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7ab5d9e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7ab5d9e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5e36713 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5e36713" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Butterfield Bathroom Renovations started as part of Butterfield Home Renovations.</p><p>After working in the home renovation market for a period of time, we recognised there was a need for a company that specialises in bathrooms.</p><p>By creating Butterfield Bathroom Renovations we are able to have a team that is committed to providing quality finished bathrooms and at the same time having the support and expertise of our home renovation company to call upon if required.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8a21798 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8a21798" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-045abfe elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="045abfe" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="800" height="640" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/5ed74b0b913571c65aaa1a8d_200316-Bathroom-expert-1024x819.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-330" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/5ed74b0b913571c65aaa1a8d_200316-Bathroom-expert-1024x819.jpg 1024w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/5ed74b0b913571c65aaa1a8d_200316-Bathroom-expert-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/5ed74b0b913571c65aaa1a8d_200316-Bathroom-expert-768x614.jpg 768w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/5ed74b0b913571c65aaa1a8d_200316-Bathroom-expert.jpg 1080w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ae262c5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="ae262c5" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bcc4acb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bcc4acb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Meet the Team
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e716d6b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e716d6b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-badb96b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="badb96b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img decoding="async" width="645" height="609" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792bf653c90b891afe5664d_IMG-20210516-WA0000.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-334" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792bf653c90b891afe5664d_IMG-20210516-WA0000.jpg 645w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792bf653c90b891afe5664d_IMG-20210516-WA0000-300x283.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 645px) 100vw, 645px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4403948 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4403948" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c1be71c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c1be71c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Neil Butterfield
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ab521ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ab521ec" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The Founding Father
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b8e2843 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b8e2843" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The cornerstone of Butterfield Bathroom Renovations, Neil Butterfield&#8217;s legacy is etched in his four decades of unwavering dedication to the building and renovations industry in Christchurch and Canterbury. This seasoned Licensed Building Practitioner, with an additional ten years of home renovation expertise in London, traces his foundational years to Melbourne, where he honed his craft through a joinery apprenticeship.</p><p>The 70s saw Neil, with tools in hand, journeying across the globe, mastering his trade with every stop. It was during these travels that fate intertwined him with his soon-to-be Kiwi wife, culminating in his decision to make Christchurch his permanent abode. Specializing in detailed repair and renovation work, Neil stands as a veritable encyclopedia in the realm of building challenges. From rot and borer to rising damp, Neil&#8217;s vast experience suggests that if he hasn&#8217;t encountered a specific problem, it&#8217;s likely a rarity. Entrusting a project to Neil means benefiting from a wealth of knowledge, experience, and a passion that has stood the test of time.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5dc71d9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5dc71d9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ade16d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="ade16d8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2-1024x1024.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-343" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2-768x768.webp 768w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2-1536x1536.webp 1536w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbc84203ede4bd658b4b0_20210922_132836-2.webp 1584w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1aaf63d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1aaf63d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a387cc2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="a387cc2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Guy Butterfield
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cd9668e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="cd9668e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Head of Production</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4955a24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4955a24" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>At the heart of Butterfield Bathroom Renovations lies the strategic acumen and visionary leadership of Guy Butterfield. As the guiding force behind the company&#8217;s direction, Guy&#8217;s primary focus now centers on overarching management, while also lending vital support to the operations and sales teams. While he initially helmed the bathroom projects, the company&#8217;s growth has allowed him to concentrate more on broader business strategies.</p><p>A proud alumnus of the University of Canterbury, Guy boasts both an Engineering Degree and a Masters in Engineering Management. His early professional ventures immersed him in the meticulous world of large-scale engineering construction projects across New Zealand, Australia, and the United Kingdom. This expansive experience instilled in him a deep appreciation for attention to detail—a principle he has seamlessly infused into every facet of Butterfield Bathroom Renovations.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65cfc9b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="65cfc9b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-383ddba elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="383ddba" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="485" height="488" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792c2f187e636156cff2352_Headshot-Brooke.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-340" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792c2f187e636156cff2352_Headshot-Brooke.jpg 485w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792c2f187e636156cff2352_Headshot-Brooke-298x300.jpg 298w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792c2f187e636156cff2352_Headshot-Brooke-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 485px) 100vw, 485px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2cf0eee e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2cf0eee" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4fc702b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="4fc702b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Brooke Lush
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eddc251 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="eddc251" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sales and Showroom Coordinator</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b48f502 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b48f502" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Brooke Lush expertly manages Butterfield Bathrooms&#8217; intimate design space, where she facilitates essential connections between customers and designers. With a keen understanding of both product details and customer needs, Brooke ensures that each consultation is productive and personalized.</p><p>Her role extends beyond traditional showroom duties; Brooke excels in coordinating in-home design consultations, where the true potential of a space can be realized and discussed in context. Her ability to match the right designer with the right customer ensures that each project is approached with a tailored strategy, maximizing satisfaction and creative output.</p><p>Under Brooke’s coordination, the design process is streamlined and effective, focusing on practical and personal design solutions that resonate with our clients’ visions. Her strategic approach and dedication to customer service make her an indispensable link in turning design aspirations into reality.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9dd1612 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9dd1612" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fd4a341 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="fd4a341" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="1000" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20_BBTEAMPHOTOS2025-1-819x1024.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1372" alt="Bathroom &amp; Kitchen Designer - Marcia Butterfield" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20_BBTEAMPHOTOS2025-1-819x1024.png 819w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20_BBTEAMPHOTOS2025-1-240x300.png 240w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20_BBTEAMPHOTOS2025-1-768x960.png 768w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/20_BBTEAMPHOTOS2025-1.png 900w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-204e548 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="204e548" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d8c7860 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d8c7860" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Marcia Butterfield</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15e099d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="15e099d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Designer
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9bcbc4a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9bcbc4a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p data-start="31" data-end="335">A trailblazer in design and curation, Marcia Butterfield stands at the unique intersection of space curation and transformative design. As the mastermind behind the renowned platform &#8220;Neat Places,&#8221; she&#8217;s showcased her impeccable ability to discover and elevate the charm of New Zealand&#8217;s diverse locales.</p><p> </p><p data-start="337" data-end="808" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Transitioning this innate flair to Butterfield Bathrooms, Marcia crafts bathroom spaces that are more than just functional. They&#8217;re veritable narratives of elegance, innovation, and personal expression. Drawing deep inspiration from her travels and curations, each of her projects carries an eclectic and captivating touch. Collaborating with Marcia isn&#8217;t just about redesign; it&#8217;s an invitation to embrace a richer, more layered experience in every corner of your space.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-39a9db7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="39a9db7" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8014c32 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="8014c32" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="759" height="736" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792b9eed0a23c4981deb571_Casey-Head-Shot-1.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-344" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792b9eed0a23c4981deb571_Casey-Head-Shot-1.webp 759w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792b9eed0a23c4981deb571_Casey-Head-Shot-1-300x291.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 759px) 100vw, 759px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4b38a5e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4b38a5e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9a3b76a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9a3b76a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Casey Bennette
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-142b798 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="142b798" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Designer
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e9b59c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6e9b59c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Casey Bennett joins Butterfield Bathrooms, bringing a unique concoction of technical prowess and creative zest. Her journey from architectural technician at Warren and Mahoney to graphic design guru at Pasta Vera Ltd. has equipped her with a versatile toolkit that perfectly suits our innovative approach to bathroom design.</p><p>Casey’s ability to weave architectural discipline with graphic flair allows her to transform functional spaces into works of art. Her expertise in design programs, combined with a passionate commitment to architectural aesthetics, prepares her to lead our design projects into new realms of elegance and efficiency.</p><p>Keep your eyes peeled as Casey infuses her fresh, creative insights into our projects, promising to redefine the spaces we craft. Her dedication to design excellence is set to leave an indelible mark on the homes and lives of our clients.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-81e79c7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="81e79c7" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-61f3b41 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="61f3b41" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="777" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415bc3a9ec8c1598201c89_Peter-Rattray-Copy-1024x994.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-352" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415bc3a9ec8c1598201c89_Peter-Rattray-Copy-1024x994.webp 1024w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415bc3a9ec8c1598201c89_Peter-Rattray-Copy-300x291.webp 300w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415bc3a9ec8c1598201c89_Peter-Rattray-Copy-768x746.webp 768w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415bc3a9ec8c1598201c89_Peter-Rattray-Copy.webp 1419w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-391b2fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="391b2fb" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bcfbc1c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bcfbc1c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Peter Rattray
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8e1dfc1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8e1dfc1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Estimator
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0a381e7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0a381e7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Peter&#8217;s professional background is as varied as it is impressive. Starting out as a qualified chef, he has a taste for precision and excellence, which he seamlessly transitioned into his later pursuits. His technical acumen as a computer systems technician further honed his analytical skills and attention to detail, attributes that are indispensable in quality surveying.</p><p>Not stopping there, Peter is also a qualified carpenter, which brings a practical, hands-on dimension to his current role. His extensive experience in bathroom renovations cements his reputation as not just a jack of all trades but a master of them as well. This unique combination of skills ensures that Peter is not only adept at assessing and managing project costs but also deeply understands the construction and renovation process from multiple perspectives.</p><p>At Butterfield Bathrooms, Peter is renowned for his meticulous approach and is the go-to expert for ensuring projects are feasible, well-planned, and executed with the utmost quality. His longstanding dedication and versatile capabilities make him an invaluable asset to the team and a cornerstone of the company&#8217;s enduring legacy.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-02fc9cb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="02fc9cb" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-faed3cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="faed3cb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="694" height="637" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415b4184a3010ab67b16f6_Cam-McDonald-Copy.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-353" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415b4184a3010ab67b16f6_Cam-McDonald-Copy.jpg 694w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/66415b4184a3010ab67b16f6_Cam-McDonald-Copy-300x275.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 694px) 100vw, 694px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4cf9c9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b4cf9c9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-910fe7b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="910fe7b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Cam MacDonald
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dd218df elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="dd218df" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Operations Manager
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0245229 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0245229" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Cam MacDonald, the dynamic Operations Manager at Butterfield Bathrooms, is a synthesis of craftsmanship and adventure. As a qualified builder, Cam possesses a deep-rooted understanding of construction intricacies, honed further by a decade in Scotland&#8217;s challenging environments, maintaining offshore oil rigs. This rigorous experience instilled in him a meticulous approach to details and a resilience that&#8217;s hard to match. Beyond the bricks and mortar, Cam&#8217;s passion for diving offers him a unique perspective on fluidity and design, allowing him to envision spaces that are as harmonious as they are functional. With Cam at the helm, projects not only achieve architectural excellence but also embody a spirit of boundless exploration.
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8363819 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8363819" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0ef85d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="0ef85d2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="566" height="525" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792bc38e04566c85d2438fb_Paul-Head-Shot.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-354" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792bc38e04566c85d2438fb_Paul-Head-Shot.webp 566w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6792bc38e04566c85d2438fb_Paul-Head-Shot-300x278.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 566px) 100vw, 566px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8ee5400 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8ee5400" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-47e5698 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="47e5698" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Paul Vallance - Liberty
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bd68c8e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bd68c8e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Project Lead
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-19b9f7c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="19b9f7c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Paul Vallance serves as the skilled Project Lead at Butterfield Bathrooms, where his extensive carpentry experience and adept project management ensure each bathroom renovation is executed with precision. Paul’s career spans a variety of settings, from residential to commercial builds, allowing him to efficiently handle every aspect of a project from start to finish.</p><p>With a strong focus on problem-solving and effective team coordination, Paul ensures that projects proceed smoothly and meet all specifications. His commitment to excellence in following architectural and engineering plans, coupled with his ability to maintain high standards of health and safety, guarantees top-quality results. Under Paul&#8217;s watch, Butterfield Bathrooms consistently delivers renovations that are both functional and aesthetically pleasing, faithfully bringing the client&#8217;s vision to life.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a5731d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7a5731d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-63e8793 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="63e8793" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="641" height="1024" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al-641x1024.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1374" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al-641x1024.jpg 641w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al-188x300.jpg 188w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al-768x1226.jpg 768w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al-962x1536.jpg 962w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al-1283x2048.jpg 1283w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Team-Lead-Al.jpg 1503w" sizes="(max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-165e721 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="165e721" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5826ca5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5826ca5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Allan Moseley</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4663d01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="4663d01" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Project Lead
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c912c5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c912c5a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p data-start="0" data-end="323">Allan Moseley brings strong leadership and hands-on building expertise to every renovation. Having previously run his own construction company, Allan understands what it takes to deliver projects efficiently, communicate clearly, and maintain high standards from start to finish.</p><p data-start="325" data-end="712">He completed his apprenticeship at the same time and with the same company as Cam MacDonald, building a solid foundation that has carried through his career. With extensive experience in the renovation space, Allan approaches each project with practical knowledge and a solutions-focused mindset, ensuring work progresses smoothly while maintaining a strong focus on quality workmanship.</p><p> </p><p data-start="714" data-end="900" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Reliable, experienced, and grounded in real-world renovation practice, Allan plays a key role in delivering bathrooms that are built to last and finished to a consistently high standard.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c662cf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2c662cf" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b7e45f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="b7e45f4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="822" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/64f4f6e358f6038b2af58792_Nathan-2.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-357" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/64f4f6e358f6038b2af58792_Nathan-2.webp 839w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/64f4f6e358f6038b2af58792_Nathan-2-292x300.webp 292w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/64f4f6e358f6038b2af58792_Nathan-2-768x789.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c69112b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c69112b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-901cb5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="901cb5c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Nathan Tunnah
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6ab4307 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6ab4307" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Essential Bathrooms Operator</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-66343f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="66343f3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Nathan Tunnah is Butterfield Bathrooms&#8217; specialist in shower repairs and installations, focusing on the functionality and durability of each project. As a qualified builder, Nathan brings a robust understanding of construction fundamentals to tackle the practical challenges inherent in shower work. His commitment to high-quality craftsmanship ensures each repair or installation is completed to the highest standard, prioritizing efficiency and reliability.</p><p>Nathan&#8217;s approach is straightforward and focused, emphasizing the operational aspects of each job to ensure that showers are not only fixed or installed correctly but are also built to last. His expertise in this area makes him a critical resource for Butterfield Bathrooms, entrusted with delivering solid and sustainable solutions in every project</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-304ac5e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="304ac5e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-89687f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="89687f4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="720" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6641661079f22e61f834f697_Anitelea-Mulipola-1024x922.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-358" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6641661079f22e61f834f697_Anitelea-Mulipola-1024x922.jpg 1024w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6641661079f22e61f834f697_Anitelea-Mulipola-300x270.jpg 300w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6641661079f22e61f834f697_Anitelea-Mulipola-768x691.jpg 768w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/6641661079f22e61f834f697_Anitelea-Mulipola.jpg 1365w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15e2a55 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="15e2a55" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c7e696 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2c7e696" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Anitele'a Mulipola
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-48fd5ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="48fd5ce" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Bathroom Renovator - Carpentry
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c3c0a94 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c3c0a94" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Anitele&#8217;a Mulipola, a key member of the Butterfield Bathrooms ensemble, seamlessly blends the roles of a laborer with that of an experienced bathroom renovator. He thrives in the thick of the action, expertly handling the rigorous phases of a project, from the initial demolition and first fix carpentry all the way to gib fixing. Anitele&#8217;a&#8217;s journey began in the world of commercial construction, where he cultivated a foundation of robust skills and knowledge. Prior to joining our team, he was deeply involved in the construction of a new dam in Marlborough, a testament to his versatility and adaptability. His broad experience, combined with a relentless work ethic, ensures that each bathroom transformation progresses smoothly and efficiently, setting the stage for the final design vision to come to life.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-17fe991 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="17fe991" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c6e4322 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="c6e4322" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbdd4c8ec9fb7902dc383_IMG-20220423-WA0003-2.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-359" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbdd4c8ec9fb7902dc383_IMG-20220423-WA0003-2.jpg 898w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbdd4c8ec9fb7902dc383_IMG-20220423-WA0003-2-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbdd4c8ec9fb7902dc383_IMG-20220423-WA0003-2-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/629dbdd4c8ec9fb7902dc383_IMG-20220423-WA0003-2-768x768.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4583e12 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4583e12" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-708833e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="708833e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Mark Butterfield
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-310c980 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="310c980" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Technical Consultation
</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e3caa14 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e3caa14" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Though Mark has recently taken a step back from the day-to-day operations of Butterfield Home Renovations, his indelible influence remains woven into the fabric of the company. Mark&#8217;s transition back to Gosford, Australia, his wife&#8217;s hometown, may have geographically distanced him from Christchurch, but his decade-long tenure in the aftermath of the earthquakes has solidified his reputation as an unmatched technical maestro in the renovations realm.</p><p>Armed with an Engineering Degree, Mark is renowned for his deep understanding of the building code and an unwavering passion for technical detail. This expertise has crowned him the company&#8217;s ultimate authority on technical solutions and code compliance. Mark&#8217;s illustrious career has been punctuated by negotiation and project management roles in engineering construction projects, particularly within the mining and public sectors in both New Zealand and Australia. Even from afar, Mark&#8217;s legacy and counsel remain invaluable assets to the Butterfield team.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-db8a951 elementor-widget elementor-widget-google_maps" data-id="db8a951" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="google_maps.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-custom-embed">
			<iframe loading="lazy"
					src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Butterfield%20Bathroom%20Renovations%20&#038;t=m&#038;z=10&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near"
					title="Butterfield Bathroom Renovations "
					aria-label="Butterfield Bathroom Renovations "
			></iframe>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fee6c13 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="fee6c13" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-efb4b8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="efb4b8b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Book a Free Consultation Today
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-53e6300 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="53e6300" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									You can rely on our fully trained specialist tradespeople to provide guaranteed total attention to detail and focus on quality at all times.
								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a8e495d elementor-align-justify elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="a8e495d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/contact-us/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Contact us</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<footer data-elementor-type="footer" data-elementor-id="293" class="elementor elementor-293 elementor-location-footer" data-elementor-post-type="elementor_library">
			<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-056a7b3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="056a7b3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
